#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Hotunan fuskarka da Ubuntu Hello kwatanta da. Ajiye aƙalla biyu, rikodin a "
"cikin haske daban-daban."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Nuna samfura da aka adana don:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Samfurin fuska ɗaya kawai aka yi rajista. Haske yana canza yadda fuskarka ke "
"kallon kyamara, don haka ƙirar guda ɗaya na iya yin kasala da yamma a "
"ƙarƙashin fitilu (ko a cikin hasken rana). Ƙara samfurin na biyu da aka yi "
"rikodin a cikin haske daban-daban don ci gaba da buɗe abin dogaro a kowane "
"lokaci na rana."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ƙara samfuri na biyu"

