#: src/main.ui:435
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Sanarwa ta tebur tana nuna yayin da Ubuntu Hello ke neman fuskarka, sannan "
"ta ba da rahoton sakamakon. Ƙoƙarin da bai yi nasara ba ya tsaya a cikin "
"lissafin sanarwa."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Nuna sanarwa"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kati ɗaya kowane ƙoƙari na tabbatar da fuska, wanda aka sabunta a wurin tare "
"da sakamakon."

#: src/main.ui:503
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sautin sanarwa"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Kunna sautin tsarin don yunƙurin da aka sani ko gazawa."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Haɗa bincike"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ƙara samfuri, tabbaci vs. kofa, firam, kamara da lokaci zuwa kowane kati. "
"Yana da amfani lokacin bayar da rahoton matsala."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Maɓalli / KW⟧ Buɗewa ta atomatik"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kunna tantancewar fuska don buɗe maɓallin shiga ta atomatik ko KWallet "
"lokacin shiga. Wannan yana adana amintaccen kalmar sirrin ku a rufe a cikin "
"TPM idan akwai, ko rufaffen ta da AES-256-GCM ta amfani da maɓalli na tushen "
"kawai. Face auth saita PAM_AUTHTOK don pam_gnome_keyring ko pam_kwallet5 "
"dangane da tebur ɗin ku."

